WEBVTT

00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:04.990
It's hot...

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:07.570
It's hot...

00:00:07.570 --> 00:00:09.610
Hey, Sella, turn up the A/C!

00:00:09.890 --> 00:00:14.360
No. If you rely on A/C too much, 
your body will grow weak.

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:16.040
Aww...

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:18.560
What? You look awfully worn out.

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:20.790
Onii-chan, aren't you hot?

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:24.370
It might actually be hotter in the house.

00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:25.750
There's no breeze, after all.

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:26.880
Huh...

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:28.360
Oh, right... You two...

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:29.750
What?

00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:32.560
If you're free, could you help me?

00:02:04.130 --> 00:02:06.730
It's still hot out here,

00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:10.540
but I guess it does feel better than inside.

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:16.340
Hey, Kuro? Kuro!

00:02:16.340 --> 00:02:18.290
Why are you spacing out?

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:21.410
I wasn't spacing out.

00:02:21.410 --> 00:02:22.820
You were.

00:02:22.820 --> 00:02:23.990
Was not!

00:02:23.990 --> 00:02:27.540
Are you sure you're not just 
going crazy from the heat?

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:31.610
Hey, what are you doing, Kuro?

00:02:32.520 --> 00:02:34.380
Cooling you off!

00:02:35.580 --> 00:02:37.460
Next up is the backyard.

00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:40.610
It's easy, since there's a hose and a spigot.

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:46.780
My, Illya-chan and Kuro-chan. Yoo-hoo!

00:02:47.360 --> 00:02:49.000
What are you doing, Mama?

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:51.290
Well, it's hot outside today, right?

00:02:51.290 --> 00:02:55.820
Besides, you went to the beach recently, 
but we didn't get to go.

00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:59.660
In truth, we were also impelled 
by a desire to enjoy the water.

00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:01.160
That's how this happened.

00:03:01.350 --> 00:03:02.600
You, too, Liz?

00:03:02.600 --> 00:03:04.030
How carefree.

00:03:04.290 --> 00:03:05.870
It feels good!

00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:07.410
Why don't you come in, too?

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:10.930
I'll pass. It looks cramped.

00:03:10.930 --> 00:03:13.490
Huh? But that's the good part...

00:03:13.490 --> 00:03:17.110
After I finish helping, I'll think about it.

00:03:17.110 --> 00:03:18.090
Helping?

00:03:18.390 --> 00:03:20.580
Watering the trees in the yard.

00:03:22.520 --> 00:03:23.840
I'll be using the hose.

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:26.780
Come to think of it, we've lost a bit of water.

00:03:26.780 --> 00:03:29.370
Illya, while you're at it, can you top us off?

00:03:29.370 --> 00:03:30.600
Sure.

00:03:32.620 --> 00:03:36.400
Oh, fresh water feels good...

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:38.540
This is the best.

00:03:39.140 --> 00:03:40.190
She fell asleep.

00:03:40.190 --> 00:03:41.560
She really is too carefree.

00:03:45.090 --> 00:03:46.370
What are you doing?

00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:49.300
Oh, Shirou. Would you like to join us?

00:03:49.300 --> 00:03:51.080
Wh-What are you saying?

00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:53.070
I take it back!

00:03:54.840 --> 00:03:57.380
If Onii-chan's joining, maybe I will, too.

00:03:57.380 --> 00:03:58.550
Huh?

00:03:58.830 --> 00:04:04.340
Being squeezed into a tight space 
sounds fun, if it's with Onii-chan!

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:06.180
What are you saying, Kuro?!

00:04:08.210 --> 00:04:09.770
It's all right, Onii-chan.

00:04:09.770 --> 00:04:14.240
In a cramped pool, you can touch your cute 
sister anywhere, and it's just an accident.

00:04:14.240 --> 00:04:16.270
I haven't said anything!

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:17.730
Kuro! Listen, you...

00:04:17.930 --> 00:04:19.260
My, my.

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:39.410
Hey, Mama!

00:04:39.410 --> 00:04:40.630
What are you doing?

00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:42.220
What's wrong?

00:04:42.220 --> 00:04:45.000
I want to play in the water 
with my beloved children.

00:04:46.790 --> 00:04:48.640
You, too, Shirou.

00:04:48.840 --> 00:04:53.600
W-Well, just... I mean... 
At least change first.

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:01.780
Oh, my!

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:04.990
It sure is loud out here. What are you all—

00:05:07.940 --> 00:05:09.450
Shirou...

00:05:13.570 --> 00:05:15.160
Why me?!

00:05:16.840 --> 00:05:19.280
Good grief. If you're going 
to play in the water,

00:05:19.280 --> 00:05:20.890
at least put on swimsuits first!

00:05:20.890 --> 00:05:22.920
R-Right...

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:24.950
Oh, that reminds me, madam.

00:05:24.950 --> 00:05:25.880
What?

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:29.710
Just a moment ago, our 
neighbor's servant came to visit.

00:05:29.710 --> 00:05:33.890
He said the mansion's reconstruction was 
just completed a short while ago.

00:05:34.210 --> 00:05:35.810
My, really?

00:05:35.810 --> 00:05:37.490
Oh, that's right.

00:05:37.490 --> 00:05:39.610
She did say it would be soon.

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:40.810
It seems that today,

00:05:40.810 --> 00:05:43.950
they're holding a lunch party to 
celebrate the reconstruction.

00:05:43.950 --> 00:05:47.930
Although it's sudden, they invited 
us to join them, if we'd like.

00:05:47.930 --> 00:05:49.320
What do you wish to do?

00:05:49.320 --> 00:05:53.080
Well, since they extended the invitation, 
why not take them up on it?

00:05:53.310 --> 00:05:55.830
Understood. Then I'll make the preparations.

00:05:56.330 --> 00:05:57.480
Oh, wait, Sella.

00:05:57.480 --> 00:05:58.250
Yes?

00:05:58.460 --> 00:06:00.580
There's still some time before lunch,

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:03.800
so why don't you get in 
the pool, too? It feels great.

00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:06.010
Huh? No, I couldn't...

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:11.510
It will take some time to find my swimsuit.

00:06:11.840 --> 00:06:13.720
Okay, I'll be waiting!

00:06:14.230 --> 00:06:16.310
<i>She wanted to get in...</i>

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:26.400
Thank you for coming.

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:28.400
Welcome, everyone.

00:06:28.660 --> 00:06:30.130
Good afternoon!

00:06:30.440 --> 00:06:32.560
Congratulations on the reconstruction.

00:06:32.560 --> 00:06:34.790
Thank you for the kind invitation.

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:39.350
Not at all. We're the ones who have 
troubled you with all the noise,

00:06:39.350 --> 00:06:42.040
so let us offer you lunch, at least.

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:45.150
It's been so long since I attended a house party.

00:06:45.150 --> 00:06:47.720
Thank you. Guten tag.

00:06:47.930 --> 00:06:51.450
It's kind of fun, getting to eat outside, huh?

00:06:51.450 --> 00:06:52.230
Yeah.

00:06:52.230 --> 00:06:54.050
Looks like there's a lot, too.

00:06:54.540 --> 00:06:56.310
Thanks, Luvia.

00:06:58.890 --> 00:07:00.800
Ah, Shero! Shero!

00:07:00.800 --> 00:07:02.140
You're so...

00:07:02.960 --> 00:07:05.610
<i>Building relations with the 
entire family... At home...</i>

00:07:05.610 --> 00:07:11.230
<i>It wouldn't be a stretch to say we're 
already starting to share our lives!</i>

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:13.120
Whoa!

00:07:15.310 --> 00:07:16.830
What are you doing?!

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:22.730
Oh, sorry. Your twisty ringlets made me dizzy, 
and I couldn't walk straight.

00:07:22.730 --> 00:07:25.530
You brazen...

00:07:25.530 --> 00:07:26.840
Hold it right there!

00:07:27.590 --> 00:07:30.360
You two are the same as always... I guess.

00:07:27.590 --> 00:07:30.360
But I can't look like this in front of Shero!

00:07:30.360 --> 00:07:31.590
Handkerchief, handkerchief...

00:07:33.150 --> 00:07:36.040
Oh, thanks. Sorry for the trouble.

00:07:36.040 --> 00:07:39.030
I-I'm just doing my job, is all.

00:07:39.030 --> 00:07:41.480
It's not like I'm doing it for your sake!

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:43.450
Wow, that's a template.

00:07:43.450 --> 00:07:45.860
Miyu, don't you have to work?

00:07:46.050 --> 00:07:48.900
No. Rin-san's handling the service today.

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:50.790
Though I feel a little guilty.

00:07:50.790 --> 00:07:53.630
Oh! Then we can eat together!

00:07:53.630 --> 00:07:54.450
Yeah.

00:07:54.640 --> 00:07:57.250
Anyway, everyone's here now.

00:07:57.250 --> 00:08:00.080
Let's begin the party.

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:03.130
Everyone, please enjoy yourselves to the fullest!

00:08:03.130 --> 00:08:04.840
Cheers!

00:08:09.200 --> 00:08:10.630
I see...

00:08:17.210 --> 00:08:18.480
Yoo-hoo!

00:08:18.480 --> 00:08:19.740
Oh, hello.

00:08:19.740 --> 00:08:21.520
Was everything to your satisfaction?

00:08:21.840 --> 00:08:24.220
Yes, it was very good.

00:08:24.220 --> 00:08:27.310
And I'm sorry. I still haven't thanked 
you for the other time.

00:08:27.650 --> 00:08:29.880
Oh, when you came to school?

00:08:29.880 --> 00:08:33.570
No need to thank us, Mother of Shero.

00:08:33.820 --> 00:08:37.530
I would like to do something to return 
the favor, though... Let me see...

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:39.350
No, it's really fine.

00:08:39.350 --> 00:08:40.950
That's right, there's no need to—

00:08:40.950 --> 00:08:44.670
I only have these pictures of Shirou 
I happened to bring with me.

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:48.840
Would you like them?

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:52.890
No, Mother. I don't think it's 
right to accept such things.

00:08:52.890 --> 00:08:55.800
These days, there are so many 
issues with personal privacy—

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:57.320
What's your hand doing?!

00:08:57.320 --> 00:09:00.500
W-Well, out here, they might 
get blown away by the wind.

00:09:00.500 --> 00:09:03.180
I thought I'd take them to ensure 
they can't be misused.

00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:04.910
Such an obvious lie!

00:09:04.910 --> 00:09:06.970
You're the one most likely to misuse them!

00:09:06.970 --> 00:09:10.480
Don't start playing the good girl, 
Tohsaka Rin! Even you...

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:14.070
What a sinful boy, that Shirou.

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:18.330
Well, what should I help myself to next?

00:09:29.020 --> 00:09:31.480
W-Well, what should I...

00:09:31.480 --> 00:09:34.020
Is my meat not to your liking?

00:09:34.020 --> 00:09:36.050
N-No, I'll have some.

00:09:38.660 --> 00:09:40.330
Please be careful.

00:09:40.330 --> 00:09:46.370
This knife is sharp enough to slay a 
vicious American bison in one slash.

00:09:46.370 --> 00:09:50.780
Compared to that, it would be no 
matter to use it on any pest...

00:09:50.780 --> 00:09:54.690
Pardon, any person trying to draw 
close to the young lady.

00:09:54.990 --> 00:09:57.150
O-Oh...

00:10:07.260 --> 00:10:08.930
There we go.

00:10:08.930 --> 00:10:10.920
This is kind of nice.

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:12.500
It's peaceful.

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:13.720
Yeah.

00:10:19.020 --> 00:10:20.570
Have you forgotten, Illya?

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:24.810
They said it would be about the same time 
as the mansion's reconstruction.

00:10:24.810 --> 00:10:25.810
Oh...

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:29.440
Yes. Once the party's over, 
let's hold our strategy meeting.

00:10:29.640 --> 00:10:33.300
Could you tell them you have plans 
to play with Miyu, and stay behind?

00:10:34.010 --> 00:10:35.650
It's time to make our move.

00:10:40.090 --> 00:10:43.530
All right, then, the celebratory mood ends here.

00:10:43.530 --> 00:10:49.000
<b>Strategy Meeting 

00:10:44.530 --> 00:10:47.460
This is a strategy meeting 
for recovery of the eighth Card!

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:55.460
<b>Mirror World</b>

00:10:49.840 --> 00:10:53.110
The drilling finished around the same 
time as the reconstruction.

00:10:53.110 --> 00:10:55.460
We can finally reach the Card's location.

00:10:55.460 --> 00:11:00.800
All that's left is jumping to the Mirror World 
and collecting the Card, just as before.

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:05.060
Will we be the only ones going 
to retrieve the Card?

00:11:05.060 --> 00:11:08.380
Good question. That's the first problem we face.

00:11:09.200 --> 00:11:12.930
As for Bazett, she'll be accompanying us.

00:11:14.300 --> 00:11:17.160
Though, of course, she isn't our ally.

00:11:17.160 --> 00:11:21.200
She'll be competing with us to see 
who can obtain the Card first.

00:11:21.570 --> 00:11:23.160
Competing, huh?

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:24.320
<i>Good grief.</i>

00:11:24.320 --> 00:11:26.740
<i>I wonder what kind of power game 
is being played at the top.</i>

00:11:27.010 --> 00:11:28.620
Then we need to strike fast!

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:32.970
Let's finish it in a flash, and retrieve the 
Card before that berserker woman can!

00:11:29.970 --> 00:11:31.690
S-Stop...

00:11:33.130 --> 00:11:35.460
It won't be that easy.

00:11:35.720 --> 00:11:36.920
What do you mean?

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:38.610
Our second problem.

00:11:38.610 --> 00:11:42.260
The eighth Card has absorbed more 
mana than any before it.

00:11:42.890 --> 00:11:46.210
Of all places, it was right in 
the trunk of the ley line.

00:11:46.210 --> 00:11:47.860
For the past two and half months,

00:11:47.860 --> 00:11:50.980
it's been continuously absorbing 
an absurd amount of mana.

00:11:51.360 --> 00:11:54.440
Enough to shrink the ley lines?

00:11:54.820 --> 00:11:59.310
We can't even speculate what 
kind of monster it's become.

00:11:59.930 --> 00:12:04.990
However, is that not all the more reason to 
end this at once, as Kuro-sama suggested?

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:08.520
Exactly. Its identity is unknown,

00:12:08.520 --> 00:12:10.690
and it's most likely the 
strongest enemy we've faced.

00:12:10.690 --> 00:12:13.460
There's only one strategy 
we can utilize against it.

00:12:14.090 --> 00:12:16.920
To engage it with max firepower 
and end it with the first strike!

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:25.390
However... Illya, what Cards do you have, again?

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:27.220
Huh? Uh...

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:30.430
Caster, Assassin, and Berserker.

00:12:30.690 --> 00:12:32.240
Those three...

00:12:32.240 --> 00:12:34.400
Caster's Include is a short sword.

00:12:34.400 --> 00:12:38.350
Assassin's is a decoy. They all lack 
the decisive edge we need.

00:12:38.350 --> 00:12:40.440
D-Doesn't it depend on how we use them?

00:12:40.960 --> 00:12:42.780
How about Berserker?

00:12:42.780 --> 00:12:45.090
It turned into this huge sword,

00:12:45.090 --> 00:12:47.370
but it was too heavy to lift.

00:12:47.790 --> 00:12:49.830
So, useless in action, huh?

00:12:50.220 --> 00:12:53.160
<i>There's the option of Installing them...</i>

00:12:53.590 --> 00:12:55.660
<i>But Miyu isn't saying anything, huh?</i>

00:12:56.350 --> 00:12:58.540
Well, even if we don't rely on the Cards,

00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:01.390
we always have our plan to use max firepower.

00:13:01.390 --> 00:13:04.880
Yes, but I'm sure there will 
be plenty of difficulties.

00:13:05.330 --> 00:13:08.050
Anyway, we take action tonight, at midnight.

00:13:08.370 --> 00:13:10.510
This is our true final battle.

00:13:11.040 --> 00:13:13.230
We'll use everything at our disposal,

00:13:13.690 --> 00:13:14.700
and win!

00:13:18.420 --> 00:13:19.820
Our final one, huh?

00:13:19.820 --> 00:13:25.030
It doesn't feel that way, but I guess 
I should practice for a bit.

00:13:25.310 --> 00:13:27.800
What a splendid attitude, Illya-san!

00:13:27.800 --> 00:13:32.490
I'll start practicing my victory 
dance, so I don't lose, too!

00:13:32.490 --> 00:13:33.860
What the heck?

00:13:33.860 --> 00:13:37.450
Well, for now, just do what you can.

00:13:37.450 --> 00:13:42.250
The comforting character, Ruby-chan, 
will try out new ways to comfort everyone!

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:43.980
Do what I can, huh?

00:13:43.980 --> 00:13:47.120
Yeah. I'll do my best, too!

00:13:54.300 --> 00:13:57.390
Miyu-sama, you should get some rest.

00:13:57.390 --> 00:14:01.330
No, I want to do everything I can now.

00:14:01.330 --> 00:14:03.350
We don't know what will happen.

00:14:04.260 --> 00:14:05.160
Miyu?

00:14:05.540 --> 00:14:06.380
Illya...

00:14:07.080 --> 00:14:10.490
Um, is it okay if I practice with you, too?

00:14:11.820 --> 00:14:12.690
Of course.

00:14:23.450 --> 00:14:24.920
For both you and I,

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:26.970
this is not a simple plan.

00:14:26.970 --> 00:14:28.490
I know.

00:14:28.490 --> 00:14:30.180
But we have to do it, right?

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:33.530
I don't mind, but are you sure?

00:14:33.820 --> 00:14:36.150
Won't this blow through your assets?

00:14:36.720 --> 00:14:38.330
It can't be helped.

00:14:38.330 --> 00:14:42.150
After coming this far, I don't 
want to abandon it partway.

00:14:43.260 --> 00:14:44.940
That's a good resolve.

00:14:44.940 --> 00:14:48.110
Then I'll work you to the bone, now and forever.

00:14:50.060 --> 00:14:51.300
Keep talking.

00:14:51.300 --> 00:14:52.200
Where are you going?

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:55.840
I'm going to greet those involved before it's time.

00:14:55.840 --> 00:14:57.530
Though, there's only one.

00:15:04.190 --> 00:15:06.080
<i>The eighth Card.</i>

00:15:06.080 --> 00:15:10.020
<i>I thought it was a simple extension 
of what we've been doing, but...</i>

00:15:10.480 --> 00:15:12.730
<i>This might be a bad thing to do.</i>

00:15:12.730 --> 00:15:14.850
<i>No, even without considering that...</i>

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:23.360
<i>I have a bad feeling about this.</i>

00:15:27.680 --> 00:15:29.180
Illya-san?

00:15:29.180 --> 00:15:30.280
Bathroom.

00:15:34.190 --> 00:15:35.770
Hey, tell me, Mama.

00:15:36.780 --> 00:15:39.290
How are the Cards related to the Holy Grail War?

00:15:47.720 --> 00:15:48.910
Anxious?

00:15:50.140 --> 00:15:51.260
Luvia-san...

00:15:52.010 --> 00:15:54.940
Ever since we learned there was an eighth Card,

00:15:54.940 --> 00:15:57.270
you've been behaving strangely.

00:15:58.150 --> 00:16:00.000
Even if only a little.

00:16:00.540 --> 00:16:04.310
I don't mind if you exclude 
me from this operation.

00:16:04.310 --> 00:16:05.580
Miyu-sama!

00:16:05.580 --> 00:16:08.480
Eliminating uncertain variables is only natural.

00:16:08.480 --> 00:16:11.280
Luvia-san, you've partially noticed, haven't you?

00:16:11.670 --> 00:16:12.800
That I...

00:16:13.210 --> 00:16:14.080
Miyu.

00:16:15.130 --> 00:16:17.220
I know you have your own circumstances.

00:16:17.560 --> 00:16:21.460
Circumstances which likely involve 
a very deep problem.

00:16:21.950 --> 00:16:24.630
However, I won't ask you.

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:27.530
If you don't want to tell me, then I won't ask.

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:30.670
Whether I know or not changes nothing.

00:16:31.320 --> 00:16:32.780
After all, you're...

00:16:36.850 --> 00:16:39.790
I will handle retrieving the Cards.

00:16:39.790 --> 00:16:40.920
So...

00:16:42.240 --> 00:16:44.570
Give me a place to live.

00:16:45.000 --> 00:16:46.520
Give me food.

00:16:47.040 --> 00:16:48.600
Give me clothes.

00:16:50.410 --> 00:16:51.490
Give me

00:16:52.160 --> 00:16:53.790
a place to belong.

00:16:55.150 --> 00:16:58.360
You are my little sister.

00:17:03.890 --> 00:17:05.330
What do you mean?

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:10.500
The Holy Grail War and the Cards are related?

00:17:10.810 --> 00:17:14.340
I'd been meaning to check with Mama about it.

00:17:14.890 --> 00:17:16.720
So, Mama, tell me.

00:17:16.720 --> 00:17:19.300
How are the Cards related 
to the Holy Grail War?

00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:22.140
What do you mean, "Cards"?

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:23.920
Don't play dumb, Mama!

00:17:23.920 --> 00:17:28.480
While I was asleep, the Holy Grail War 
system was changed, wasn't it?

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:31.310
The Summoning uses the Cards as catalysts,

00:17:31.310 --> 00:17:33.000
and now it encompasses eight people!

00:17:33.000 --> 00:17:35.480
K-Kuro, explain it so I can understand, too.

00:17:35.480 --> 00:17:36.900
Illya, you be quiet!

00:17:38.260 --> 00:17:39.880
The Holy Grail War is

00:17:39.880 --> 00:17:45.160
a mock war, fought among seven Heroic 
Spirits summoned to win the Grail.

00:17:45.530 --> 00:17:49.190
The Holy Grail is a vessel of desires,
capable of granting any wish.

00:17:49.190 --> 00:17:52.260
This ritual is conducted 
in order to achieve that.

00:17:53.140 --> 00:17:56.840
The seven Heroic Spirits summoned 
are categorized in the classes of

00:17:57.260 --> 00:18:03.310
Saber, Lancer, Archer, Rider, 
Caster, Assassin, and Berserker.

00:18:03.590 --> 00:18:05.980
The same classes as on the Cards?

00:18:05.980 --> 00:18:07.930
Yes. That's all of them.

00:18:07.930 --> 00:18:12.310
That's why an eighth class does not exist,

00:18:12.310 --> 00:18:15.740
and Cards are not used to summon Heroic Spirits.

00:18:16.060 --> 00:18:19.450
So what in the world are you 
talking about, Kuro-chan?

00:18:23.680 --> 00:18:27.290
The Holy Grail War is over, right?

00:18:27.720 --> 00:18:28.790
It's over.

00:18:29.170 --> 00:18:31.290
Ten years ago, it ended before 
a conclusion was reached,

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:35.260
and Kiritsugu is currently working hard 
to ensure it doesn't occur again.

00:18:35.580 --> 00:18:37.840
Then... Then why...

00:18:41.180 --> 00:18:42.760
I'm surprised.

00:18:42.760 --> 00:18:44.720
Or rather, exasperated.

00:18:45.020 --> 00:18:47.380
Are you seriously using that as a sleeping bag?

00:18:47.380 --> 00:18:49.730
You really are penniless, aren't you?

00:18:51.830 --> 00:18:53.610
Japan is a good nation.

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:57.010
The climate's warm, and it's 
abundant in food and water.

00:18:57.420 --> 00:18:59.950
One doesn't have to worry 
about starving or freezing.

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:01.920
That doesn't mean...

00:19:02.390 --> 00:19:05.060
You know, as a mage, I had 
some kind of respect for you,

00:19:05.060 --> 00:19:08.330
since you always did your 
duty with a clear head.

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:09.780
You needn't worry.

00:19:10.470 --> 00:19:14.090
In another two hours, I'll be in top condition.

00:19:14.340 --> 00:19:16.590
All right. That's good to hear.

00:19:16.870 --> 00:19:18.040
More importantly,

00:19:18.040 --> 00:19:20.270
are you planning to use those children tonight?

00:19:20.580 --> 00:19:22.090
Illya and her friends?

00:19:22.090 --> 00:19:24.470
Of course, we're bringing all our firepower.

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:29.010
Whoever uses the power of those 
sticks doesn't affect my task.

00:19:29.470 --> 00:19:33.140
Therefore, I don't plan on reporting 
the matter to the Association,

00:19:33.140 --> 00:19:36.480
but I doubt you can hide them from 
the Old Man of the Jewels forever.

00:19:36.480 --> 00:19:39.820
W-Well, if he finds out, I'll deal with it then.

00:19:40.220 --> 00:19:43.660
I can't believe you're involving unrelated 
people... Children, at that.

00:19:44.290 --> 00:19:47.290
It's hard to respect a mage who does that.

00:19:47.290 --> 00:19:50.000
They may not be unrelated.

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:56.750
Hey, Illya! Don't pull!

00:19:57.630 --> 00:19:58.420
Oh?

00:19:59.900 --> 00:20:01.130
What are you trying to do?

00:20:01.130 --> 00:20:03.710
I still had more to ask Mama!

00:20:04.310 --> 00:20:05.650
Most likely...

00:20:06.390 --> 00:20:09.310
Mama isn't involved in this Card commotion.

00:20:09.310 --> 00:20:11.900
That's impossible! You heard her, right?

00:20:11.900 --> 00:20:16.070
The classes used in the Holy Grail War are 
identical to those on the Class Cards.

00:20:16.070 --> 00:20:18.280
That can't be a coincidence.

00:20:18.280 --> 00:20:20.030
I understand that.

00:20:20.030 --> 00:20:24.420
The Cards may very well be related 
to the Holy Grail War.

00:20:24.420 --> 00:20:25.240
But...

00:20:25.680 --> 00:20:28.580
Mama doesn't know that, 
and she isn't playing dumb!

00:20:29.430 --> 00:20:31.280
You also know, don't you?

00:20:31.280 --> 00:20:33.390
Whether Mama was lying to us or not?

00:20:35.150 --> 00:20:37.680
So this is our problem.

00:20:39.580 --> 00:20:40.590
Right.

00:20:41.460 --> 00:20:43.610
But... "Our"?

00:20:43.610 --> 00:20:46.890
Who is included in that grouping?!

00:20:47.350 --> 00:20:48.350
Kuro...

00:20:49.000 --> 00:20:52.800
The existence of these Cards is 
something that affects me personally.

00:20:53.760 --> 00:20:55.810
You understand that, don't you?!

00:20:56.090 --> 00:21:01.010
There's one who may be even more deeply
related to this situation than we are.

00:21:03.010 --> 00:21:04.810
An eighth Card...

00:21:05.720 --> 00:21:07.390
That should not

00:21:08.110 --> 00:21:09.450
exist...

00:21:09.770 --> 00:21:10.580
Miyu.

00:21:12.430 --> 00:21:16.080
It's likely that Illya and Kuro,
and perhaps Miyu as well,

00:21:16.080 --> 00:21:19.290
all have some kind of relation to these events.

00:21:19.570 --> 00:21:22.020
That girl is definitely hiding something.

00:21:22.020 --> 00:21:23.760
Something related to the Cards.

00:21:23.980 --> 00:21:26.020
You think those girls are the culprits?

00:21:26.020 --> 00:21:27.610
I didn't say that.

00:21:27.610 --> 00:21:30.720
But I don't have enough information to deny it.

00:21:30.720 --> 00:21:31.970
We should ask her!

00:21:32.390 --> 00:21:35.910
This isn't the time to avert our eyes anymore.

00:21:37.870 --> 00:21:40.620
Why would you use someone like that?

00:21:40.620 --> 00:21:43.530
Because those stupid sticks won't listen to us.

00:21:43.530 --> 00:21:46.530
But I guess that was only the initial trigger.

00:21:51.400 --> 00:21:53.890
Luvia would probably say the same.

00:21:59.990 --> 00:22:01.500
We believe in them.

00:22:02.520 --> 00:22:03.880
In their strength,

00:22:03.880 --> 00:22:06.050
even knowing how shaky they can be.

00:22:08.840 --> 00:22:10.720
And in their resolve,

00:22:11.450 --> 00:22:13.370
and the answer it will lead us to.

00:22:17.280 --> 00:22:19.860
It's almost time for us to meet up, Kuro.

00:22:20.270 --> 00:22:21.560
We need to get ready.

00:22:21.560 --> 00:22:22.570
Illya!

00:22:22.800 --> 00:22:24.020
I'm sorry, Kuro.

00:22:24.020 --> 00:22:25.530
But it's not like that.

00:22:25.960 --> 00:22:27.990
I'm not running.

00:22:28.870 --> 00:22:33.160
Right now, I don't think I can afford 
to worry about things like that.

00:22:33.630 --> 00:22:36.710
I have to concentrate my full attention 
on what's in front of me.

00:22:36.710 --> 00:22:38.300
But still...

00:22:38.300 --> 00:22:39.420
Besides,

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.460
I get the feeling something will start moving 
forward after we finish retrieving this Card.

00:22:44.460 --> 00:22:47.570
I don't know what shape that will take, though.

00:22:49.520 --> 00:22:52.310
So I believe retrieving this Card is something

00:22:52.310 --> 00:22:55.140
we need to do, to find our answer.

00:22:55.590 --> 00:22:57.810
I believe our answer lies there.

00:22:58.180 --> 00:23:00.180
There are many things we don't know,

00:23:00.180 --> 00:23:02.020
and there are many concerns, but...

00:23:03.380 --> 00:23:05.350
Let's find the answer ourselves.

00:23:05.750 --> 00:23:07.860
I'm sure we have to be the ones to find it.

00:23:10.710 --> 00:23:11.780
No matter

00:23:12.360 --> 00:23:13.990
what that answer may be,

00:23:14.680 --> 00:23:16.450
we have to see it with our own eyes.

00:23:18.600 --> 00:23:19.610
Let's go!

00:23:20.960 --> 00:23:35.960
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:21.400 --> 00:23:23.210
I'll open a path first.

00:23:23.210 --> 00:23:25.920
A mist... of black mana.

00:23:25.920 --> 00:23:27.170
Bazett-san, please!

00:23:27.170 --> 00:23:30.260
He blocked our most powerful attack?

00:23:30.260 --> 00:23:31.550
We're retreating!

00:23:31.550 --> 00:23:33.140
We won't make it in time.

00:23:33.300 --> 00:25:35.790
<b>Enforcer</b>

00:23:33.430 --> 00:23:35.790
That woman's going to die.
